{"id":"1d9a92a01d186d53","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-order2-height-of-poset.md","title":"ZFC Order2 Height Of Poset","display":"df-zfc-order2-height-of-poset — ZFC Order2 Height Of Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order2-height-of-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order2-height-of-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-order2-height-of-poset — ZFC Order2 Height Of Poset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-poset]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order2-height-of-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order2-height-of-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order2-height-of-poset — ZFC Order2 Height Of Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in V\">\\(P\\in V\\)</span> (poset carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span> (order relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> (ordinal height value)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{&lt;}\">\\(R_{&lt;}\\)</span> (strict-order witness) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> (rank function witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in P\">\\(x\\in P\\)</span> (element bound in the height supremum)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (sourced predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2HeightOfPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2HeightOfPoset}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}height\\text{-}of\\text{-}poset}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2HeightOfPoset}_S(h,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(h)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists R_{&lt;},\\alpha,r\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_{&lt;}=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in P\\times P:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land x\\neq y\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;(A\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists a\\in A\\;\\forall b\\in A\\;(\\langle b,a\\rangle\\notin R_{&lt;})))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,P,\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x\\in P\\;(r(x)=\\bigcup\\{r(y)\\cup\\{r(y)\\}:y\\in P\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R_{&lt;}\\}))\\\\\n&amp;\\land h=\\bigcup\\{r(x)\\cup\\{r(x)\\}:x\\in P\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}height\\text{-}of\\text{-}poset}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2HeightOfPoset}_S(h,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(h)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists R_{&lt;},\\alpha,r\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_{&lt;}=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in P\\times P:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land x\\neq y\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;(A\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists a\\in A\\;\\forall b\\in A\\;(\\langle b,a\\rangle\\notin R_{&lt;})))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,P,\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x\\in P\\;(r(x)=\\bigcup\\{r(y)\\cup\\{r(y)\\}:y\\in P\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R_{&lt;}\\}))\\\\\n&amp;\\land h=\\bigcup\\{r(x)\\cup\\{r(x)\\}:x\\in P\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The strict part is an explicit set witness, so the definition does not depend on an undeclared diagonal symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_P\">\\(\\Delta_P\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"R_{<}","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2HeightOfPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}height\\text{-}of\\text{-}poset}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2HeightOfPoset}_S(h,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(h)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists R_{<},\\alpha,r\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_{<}=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in P\\times P:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land x\\neq y\\}\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;(A\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists a\\in A\\;\\forall b\\in A\\;(\\langle b,a\\rangle\\notin R_{<})))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,P,\\alpha)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall x\\in P\\;(r(x)=\\bigcup\\{r(y)\\cup\\{r(y)\\}:y\\in P\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R_{<}\\}))\\\\\n&\\land h=\\bigcup\\{r(x)\\cup\\{r(x)\\}:x\\in P\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_P","display":false}],"bytes":1602,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2932","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-order2-height-of-poset.md|58-df-zfc-order2-height-of-poset]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018","5582a281f15a33c2","36d7463d215be751"]}